    <p>PharmaFlow is a software tool, not a pharmacy, prescribing service, legal adviser, accountant, or substitute for a qualified pharmacist. You remain responsible for the licences and permissions applicable to your pharmacy, lawful medicine sales, prescription checks, statutory registers and records, tax filings, and the accuracy of information entered into the service. Software availability or an automated reminder does not establish that a medicine may lawfully be sold.</p>

