    <p>Invoice scanning and other automated features can misread product names, batch numbers, expiry dates, quantities, prices, tax values, or other fields. Review and correct extracted data before saving stock, making a sale, filing a report, or relying on it for regulatory or financial purposes. You are responsible for confirming important records.</p>

