    <p><strong>Proposed launch approach:</strong> subscriptions are prepaid for the selected term and do not automatically renew. Users can cancel at any time. Unless a refund is requested and approved, cancellation stops any future renewal and access remains available until the already-paid term ends.</p>
    <p><strong>Proposed refund approach:</strong> on cancellation, the unused portion of a prepaid subscription is eligible for a pro-rata refund based on unused days, subject to applicable law. Refunds should be returned through the original payment method where practical and targeted within 7–10 business days after approval. The final policy and payment-provider process must be confirmed before launch. Nothing in these terms removes a consumer right that cannot legally be excluded.</p>

